### Important Guidelines
Language: All text in definition must be in the SAME LANGUAGE as the input text
Reasoning: Must ALWAYS be in English
Text IDs: Use the exact text_id values provided in the text elements list
Option order: Maintain order as they appear (typically A, B, C, D or labeled as option 1, 2, 3, etc.)
Answer determination:
Look for explicit answer keys, checkmarks, or correct/incorrect indicators in images
Use contextual clues from the textbook content to identify correct answers
If the question has visual context (images), analyze them for correct answer indicators
If uncertain about the correct answer, use empty string "" for correct_answer
Multiple questions: Create separate entries in the items array for each question, maintaining order
Multiple correct answers: Only use comma-separated text_ids if the activity explicitly allows multiple selections (check all that apply, select all correct answers, etc.)
